  "description": "🚀 A powerful and feature-rich JSON Viewer component for Blazor applications.\n\n\t\t\t✨ Features:\n\t\t\t• VS Code-style syntax highlighting with dark/light themes\n\t\t\t• Real-time search with highlighting and navigation\n\t\t\t• Expand/collapse JSON nodes with smooth animations\n\t\t\t• JSON statistics (size, depth, type counts)\n\t\t\t• Copy, export, and download functionality\n\t\t\t• Fully responsive and mobile-friendly\n\t\t\t• Edit mode with auto-formatting\n\t\t\t• Line numbers with active line highlighting\n\t\t\t• Keyboard shortcuts support\n\t\t\t• Zero dependencies (uses Newtonsoft.Json)\n\n\t\t\tPerfect for debugging, API testing, and data visualization!",
